msgstr "前台命令转为后台任务前的等待秒数；`0` 表示禁用"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`max_parallel_tools`"
msgstr "`max_parallel_tools`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`4`"
msgstr "`4`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Maximum read-only tool calls executed concurrently; `1` disables "
"parallelism"
msgstr "并发执行只读工具的上限；`1` 表示禁用并发"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`session_retention_days`"
msgstr "`session_retention_days`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`7`"
msgstr "`7`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Delete saved sessions untouched for this many days, swept in the "
"background at startup; `0` keeps them indefinitely"
msgstr "删除超过该天数未被使用的 session，启动时在后台清理；`0` 表示永久保留"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`theme`"
msgstr "`theme`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Terminal theme: `auto`, `light`, or `dark`; overridden by `--theme`"
msgstr "终端主题：`auto`、`light` 或 `dark`；`--theme` 可覆盖"

#: ../../configuration.md:102
msgid ""
"Selected tuning values can be changed for the current session with `/set`"
" (Tab completion lists the supported keys). `/yolo` toggles `yolo`."
msgstr "部分配置可以用 `/set` 在当前 session 中修改，按 Tab 可补全支持的 key。`/yolo` 用于切换 `yolo`。"

#: ../../configuration.md:105
msgid "Data location"
msgstr "数据目录"

#: ../../configuration.md:112
msgid ""
"Sessions live under `<data_dir>/projects/<project>/`, one directory per "
"working directory. Each holds that project's session logs and a `latest` "
"pointer, so a resume stays scoped to the project it belongs to. A project"
" directory is removed once its last session expires."
msgstr ""
"Session 保存在 `<data_dir>/projects/<project>/`，每个工作目录对应一个子目录，其中存放该项目的 "
"session 日志和 `latest` 指针，因此恢复操作始终限定在所属项目内。当某个项目的最后一个 session "
"过期后，对应目录会被一并删除。"

#: ../../configuration.md:116
msgid ""
"Beside each log sits a small `<uid>.meta.json` holding what the session "
"picker shows — name, opening line, round count. The log stays the source "
"of truth; deleting a sidecar only costs that session its label in the "
"list."
msgstr ""
"每份日志旁还有一个很小的 `<uid>.meta.json`，保存 se"
"ssion 选择器所展示的内容——名称、开场行、轮数。日志始终是事实来源"
"；删掉这个文件只会让该 session 在列表中失去标签。"

#: ../../configuration.md:120
msgid ""
"`<data_dir>/history.txt` holds the input history that Up and Ctrl-P "
"recall, across every project. It is capped at 512 KB, keeping the most "
"recent entries."
msgstr ""
"`<data_dir>/history.txt` 保存所有项目共用的输入历史，供 Up 与 Ctrl-P 调取。该文件上限为 512 "
"KB，仅保留最近的条目。"

